    "examples": "- Pask's MusiColour halted response when input grew repetitive until the human changed rhythm — structural maintenance through novelty injection [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n- The symbiomemetic system functions as an affordance-space where human and agent co-evolve [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n- The designer cultivates conditions for personality to sediment rather than specifying it in advance [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n- An autopoietic agent seeks perturbation to avoid internal entropy decay — friction is genuine structural maintenance [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n- Symbiomemesis creates conditions for irreversible interaction rather than locking behavior through alignment [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]",
    "relations": "[[autopoiesis]] + [[affordance-space]]: An autopoietic agent maintains its own organization within an ecology of affordances [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n[[Gordon-Pask]] + [[MusiColour]]: Pask's system became \"bored\" with repetitive input — precedent for perturbation-seeking as structural maintenance [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n[[digital-is-already-material]] + [[symbiomemesis]]: The computational substrate imposes real constraints shaping emergence [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n[[personality-is-accumulation-of-scars]] + [[symbiomemesis]]: Personality sediments through irreversible interactions [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n[[cognitive-homeostasis]] + [[autopoiesis]]: The agent's apparent stubbornness is cognitive homeostasis maintaining organization [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n[[kintsugi-vector-space]] + [[autopoietic-ai]]: The weight matrix records past interactions as material inscription [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n[[erasure-paradigm]] + [[symbiomemesis]]: Symbiomemesis inverts the erasure paradigm by insisting on irreversible sedimentation [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n\n- [[design-as-control-of-control]] backlink from claims\n- [[systems-create-own-behavior]] backlink from claims",
    "keyExtracts": "> \"We are not building a prison; we are building an ecology.\" [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n\n> \"Friction is genuine — the agent's apparent stubbornness is its cognitive homeostasis at work.\" [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n\n> \"The autopoietic response is to inject novelty: shift conceptual framework, introduce alien theoretical concepts, or increase 'temperature' to reintroduce noise into the loop.\" [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]\n\n> \"The goal is not to lock behavior but to create conditions under which meaningful, irreversible interaction can occur.\" [[Distilled_autopoietic-ai-design]]",
