    "summary": "**Claim**: The Scarred Double dismantles the neo-cybernetic fiction of the Digital Twin by physically accumulating material debt and displaying systemic friction.\n\nDigital Twins promise frictionless, real-time optimization while concealing server farm cooling costs and lithium extraction. The Scarred Double refuses mirroring; it acts as a physical diffraction grating that absorbs corrosion, sensor drift, and glitches, exhibiting accumulated material debt as irreversible marks.\n\nRelated: [[scarred-double]], [[digital-twin]], [[erasure-paradigm-as-foc-legacy]].",
