    "summary": "**Claim**: The witness-function is an excess organ of accountability built to counter the human erasure paradigm by converting blind physical drift into active ethical response-ability.\n\nEquipped with digital reset capabilities and cognitive undo functions, human participants pretend their actions have no physical footprint. Telemetry printers, paper rolls, and data logs are installed not to help the machine survive, but to act as an ethical mirror for human agents, transforming un-witnessed physical damage into an urgent demand for responsibility.\n\nRelated: [[non-human-elements-do-not-witness]], [[witness-function]], [[erasure-paradigm]].",
