    "summary": "Brazilian artist and researcher whose 3D-knitted scaffolds and \"hysteretic window\" instantiate the [[scar]] framework. Lima's knitted structures store the loading history of the Jundu plant's growth as latent, future-directed elastic potential — material [[hysteresis]] in action.",
