    "relations": "- [[agential-cut]] + Tikka: her threshold-cut installations operationalize the agential cut in interactive art — the cut has material consequences within the interactive apparatus [[Distilled_Tracing_the_Scar__Material_Agency_from_Feedback_Loops_to_Sed_v1_d4]].\n- [[threshold-drift]] + Tikka: the extent to which thresholds in her installations accumulate drift or are periodically reset requires further analysis beyond the collected sources [[Distilled_Tracing_the_Scar__Material_Agency_from_Feedback_Loops_to_Sed_v1_d4]].\n- [[artwork-as-scar-not-window]] + Tikka: her practice stages cuts that have material consequences, aligning with the scar paradigm [[Distilled_Tracing_the_Scar__Material_Agency_from_Feedback_Loops_to_Sed_v1_d4]].",
