    "summary": "Vasily Betin, author of \"Tracing the Scar\" (ASC Brazil 2026, Hybrid Matters track), synthesizes Barad's agential realism, von Foerster's second-order cybernetics, and Deleuze's open assemblage. He argues the feedback loop is a material process of spacetimemattering, and every intra-active pass leaves an irreversible scar. The artwork is a scar — a material record of intra-action training response-ability toward non-human entanglement.",
