    "relations": "[[feedback-loop]] + [[agential-realism|agential-materiality]]: Betin synthesizes cybernetics, Deleuze, and Barad to argue the feedback loop is a material process of spacetimemattering [[Betin2026-Tracing-the-Scar]].\r\n\r\n[[artwork-as-scar-not-window]] + [[response-ability]]: The artwork trains response-ability toward non-human entanglement by materializing irreversible scars of intra-action [[CCC-Abstract-Betin]].\r\n\r\n[[scar]]: Betin's central concept -- the irreversible material trace left by each intra-active pass, sedimenting identity as accumulation of irreversible marks [[Betin2026-Tracing-the-Scar]], [[CCC-Abstract-Betin]].\r\n\n\n- See also: [[glitch-is-voice-of-apparatus]]\n- See also: [[hysteretic-superposition]]",
