    "summary": "Algorave is a movement and performance practice where live coding generates dance music in a rave/club context. Enacts the [[agential-cut]] of algorithm performance in a social, embodied setting — code is projected, failures are audible, and the apparatus is made collectively visible [[Distilled_Lets_make_a_research_for_the_audio_part_of_the_artwork__The__v0_d2]].",
