    "summary": "[[Maturana-Varela|Maturana]]'s framework understanding cognition as a biological phenomenon. Living systems are organizationally closed and structurally coupled with their medium. Cognition is the ongoing operational coherence of the organism within its domain of interactions, emerging from [[structural-coupling]] rather than representation of an external world [[Distilled_Bridging Constructivism and Material Realism]]. This framework undergirds [[objectivity-in-parentheses]]: the observer is a biological system with specific structural constraints, so no unmediated access to an independent reality is possible. This biological constraint provides the realist check preventing [[radical-constructivism]] from collapsing into solipsism [[Distilled_Bridging Constructivism and Material Realism]].",
