    "summary": "[[Andrew-Pickering|Andrew Pickering]]'s term for the emergent, open-ended interplay between human and nonhuman agents in the [[mangle-of-practice]]. Agency arises performatively in the \"thick of things\" as an emergent property of assemblages — observer and observed are symbiotically produced. The dance defines the dancers [[Distilled_Lets_make_analysis_of_idea_of_cybernetic_observer_in_OOO_v0_d1]].",
