    "summary": "[[Adriana-Lima|Adriana Lima]]'s hysteretic window is a 3D-knitted material scaffold that stores the loading history of the Jundu plant's growth as latent, future-directed elastic potential. A practical instantiation of [[hysteresis]], the scaffold's present structural state is irreversibly shaped by every past stress event. The window actively remembers — its future capacity to respond to new forces is permanently reconfigured by its history.",
