    "relations": "- [[autopoiesis]]: ontogeny is the developmental trajectory of a self-producing system navigating perturbations while maintaining organizational identity [[Distilled_cybernetics-21-notes]].\n\n- See also: [[Humberto-Maturana]]\n- See also: [[individuation]]\n- See also: [[pre-individual-field]]",
