    "summary": "The **Thermodynamic No** refers to the irreversible physical cost imposed on matter during an agential cut or individuation process. Drawing on [[Gilbert-Simondon]] and non-equilibrium thermodynamics, it asserts that free energy spent during material collision cannot be recovered. The Thermodynamic No dismantles the fantasy of total system recovery or digital reset, establishing that every structural form created simultaneously executes the thermodynamic death of alternative potential configurations.\n\nRelated: [[shadow-of-the-counterfactual]], [[irreversibility]], [[simondon-individuation-as-spent-potential]], [[hysteretic-fold]].",
