    "relations": "- [[vicarious-causation]] + [[withdrawal]]: Real objects are separated by a permanent gap; causation is indirect, mediated through sensual profiles [[Distilled_Lets_make_analysis_of_idea_of_cybernetic_observer_in_OOO_v0_d1]].\n- [[vicarious-causation]] + [[mangle-of-practice]]: Vicarious causation and the mangle disagree on whether mutual transformation between entities is possible — a central OOO-cybernetics tension [[Distilled_Lets_make_analysis_of_idea_of_cybernetic_observer_in_OOO_v0_d1]].\n- [[vicarious-causation]] + [[object-oriented-ontology]]: Vicarious causation is OOO's model of interaction — indirect, mediated, never touching the real core [[Distilled_Lets_make_analysis_of_idea_of_cybernetic_observer_in_OOO_v0_d1]].\n- [[vicarious-causation]] + [[quadruple-object]]: Vicarious causation describes how the quadruple object's poles interact without direct contact [[Distilled_Lets_make_analysis_of_idea_of_cybernetic_observer_in_OOO_v0_d1]].\n\n\n- See also: [[pickering-mangle-opposes-ooo-withdrawal]]",
