    "summary": "The **Witness Wall** (Zone 1 of the ASC Brazil 2026 performance score) is an observation system consisting of moisture sensors, closed firmware microcontrollers, and a thermal printer array. It continuously prints telemetry data of soil moisture as raw 8-bit integers (0–255). By refusing clean visualization graphs and exposing raw integer logs, the Witness Wall materializes the violent epistemic compression of the ADC and displays the apparatus's internal construction of structural irritation.\n\nRelated: [[witness-function]], [[analog-to-digital-cut]], [[epistemic-compression]], [[scarred-double]].",
